message: "Please cite the paper (preferred-citation); if you use the code or the trained detectors, also cite the software."
title: "beyond99-banknote-detection: open-set evaluation of counterfeit banknote detectors"
abstract: >-
  Code, results and paper for open-set evaluation of counterfeit banknote
  detectors: ten supervised classifiers, four one-class detectors and four
  hybrids on the UCI Banknote Authentication data, scored by
  leave-one-family-out on counterfeit families withheld from training at a
  fixed 1% genuine-rejection budget.
type: software
